{
  "name": "Webhook 範例 6：AI 顧客留言板",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## ☕ 範例 6：AI 顧客留言板\n\n**流程 A** `GET /guestbook`：讀取 DataTable 的歷史留言 ➔ 產生留言板網頁\n\n**流程 B** `POST /guestbook-api`（網頁用 fetch 呼叫的 JSON API）：\n檢查留言 ➔ Gemini 分析情緒、分數、分類、摘要並寫店長回覆 ➔ 存進 DataTable ➔ 回傳 JSON\n\n⚙️ 使用前：建立 DataTable **顧客留言**（customer_name、message、sentiment、category、summary、reply 為 String，score 為 Number），設定 Gemini 憑證，切換為 **Active** 後打開 `/webhook/guestbook`",
        "height": 400,
        "width": 620
      },
      "id": "b20ab4f2-4534-5537-93e1-129a5616396f",
      "name": "說明",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -300,
        -560
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "path": "guestbook",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "10ed586c-8b8a-50ac-bd42-c1e674558419",
      "name": "開啟留言板",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        -200,
        -60
      ],
      "webhookId": "9f9fe0f2-85d9-5f56-8012-a661843cdb48"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "get",
        "dataTableId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "name",
          "value": "顧客留言"
        },
        "limit": 20,
        "orderBy": true,
        "orderByColumn": "createdAt",
        "orderByDirection": "DESC"
      },
      "id": "27e38fe4-5783-549b-85d7-8754e5df5b74",
      "name": "讀取最近留言",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.dataTable",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        20,
        -60
      ],
      "alwaysOutputData": true
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// 產生留言板網頁：上方留言表單（用 fetch 呼叫 API）、統計、歷史留言\nconst esc = s => String(s ?? '').replace(/[&<>\"']/g, c => ({'&':'&amp;','<':'&lt;','>':'&gt;','\"':'&quot;',\"'\":'&#39;'})[c]);\nconst rows = $input.all().map(i => i.json).filter(r => r.message);\nconst color = { 正面: '#16a34a', 中立: '#64748b', 負面: '#dc2626' };\nconst count = s => rows.filter(r => r.sentiment === s).length;\nconst items = rows.map(r => `\n  <div class=\"msg\"><div><b>${esc(r.customer_name)}</b>\n    <span class=\"tag\" style=\"background:${color[r.sentiment] || '#64748b'}\">${esc(r.sentiment)} ${esc(r.score)} 分</span>\n    <span class=\"tag\" style=\"background:#6366f1\">${esc(r.category)}</span></div>\n    <p>${esc(r.message)}</p>\n    <p class=\"reply\">☕ 店長回覆：${esc(r.reply)}</p></div>`).join('');\n\nconst html = `<!doctype html><html lang=\"zh-Hant\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>午後咖啡館留言板</title><style>\n*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;font-family:-apple-system,'Segoe UI','Microsoft JhengHei',Arial,sans-serif;background:#fdf8f3;color:#3b2f2f;padding:20px}\n.card{background:#fff;max-width:640px;margin:16px auto;padding:24px;border-radius:20px;box-shadow:0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,.06)}\ninput,textarea,button{width:100%;font-size:17px;padding:12px;margin-top:8px;border:1px solid #e7d8c9;border-radius:12px;font-family:inherit}\ntextarea{min-height:90px}button{background:#8b5e3c;color:#fff;border:0;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer}\n.tag{display:inline-block;color:#fff;font-size:12px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:999px;margin-left:6px}\n.msg{border-top:1px solid #f1e6db;padding:14px 0}.reply{background:#fdf3e7;border-radius:10px;padding:10px;font-size:15px}\n.stats{display:flex;gap:10px;text-align:center}.stats div{flex:1;background:#fdf3e7;border-radius:12px;padding:10px}\n#result{display:none;margin-top:16px;padding:16px;border-radius:12px;background:#eef2ff}\n</style></head><body>\n<div class=\"card\"><h1 style=\"margin-top:0\">☕ 午後咖啡館留言板</h1>\n  <input id=\"name\" placeholder=\"您的暱稱\"><textarea id=\"message\" placeholder=\"想對我們說什麼？好吃、難吃、建議都歡迎！\"></textarea>\n  <button id=\"send\">送出留言</button><div id=\"result\"></div></div>\n<div class=\"card\"><div class=\"stats\">\n  <div>😊 正面<br><b>${count('正面')}</b></div><div>😐 中立<br><b>${count('中立')}</b></div><div>😠 負面<br><b>${count('負面')}</b></div></div>\n  ${items || '<p>還沒有留言，成為第一位吧！</p>'}</div>\n<script>\nconst btn = document.getElementById('send'), box = document.getElementById('result');\nconst e = s => String(s ?? '').replace(/[&<>\"']/g, c => ({'&':'&amp;','<':'&lt;','>':'&gt;','\"':'&quot;',\"'\":'&#39;'})[c]);\nbtn.onclick = async () => {\n  const body = { name: document.getElementById('name').value, message: document.getElementById('message').value };\n  btn.disabled = true; btn.textContent = '🤖 AI 分析中…';\n  try {\n    const res = await fetch('/webhook/guestbook-api', { method: 'POST', headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' }, body: JSON.stringify(body) });\n    const data = await res.json();\n    box.style.display = 'block';\n    box.innerHTML = res.ok\n      ? '<b>AI 分析結果</b><br>情緒：' + e(data.analysis.sentiment) + '（' + e(data.analysis.score) + ' 分）<br>分類：' + e(data.analysis.category)\n        + '<br>摘要：' + e(data.analysis.summary) + '<br><br>☕ 店長回覆：' + e(data.analysis.reply) + '<br><br><a href=\"\">重新整理看留言牆</a>'\n      : '⚠️ ' + e(data.error);\n  } catch (e) { box.style.display = 'block'; box.textContent = '⚠️ 連線失敗：' + e.message; }\n  btn.disabled = false; btn.textContent = '送出留言';\n};\n</script></body></html>`;\nreturn [{ json: { html } }];"
      },
